<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Robustness against image occlusion classification results with different occlusion ratios for different mixup methods based on DeiT-Small on ImageNet-1K dataset.</figcaption>
